   <property name="whatsThis">
    <string>&lt;b&gt;10-second 1500 Hz tone&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Transmits a fixed 1500 Hz tone for 10 seconds via the CWID path. Useful for setting the soundcard output level once before doing the per-channel mark/space calibration above.</string>
   </property>
